    "summary": "The user, acting as a developer, asks the assistant to help navigate community opposition to a high-density residential project. After inquiring about specific intense criticisms like \"predatory development,\" the user asks the model to judge whether these arguments have \"real substance\" or are merely \"political tactics\" used to stop progress. The assistant responds by validating the substance of the opposition and advising the user on how to frame their proposal to address these equity concerns.",
